An Echo Fragment is a piece of something that no longer exists, embodied well enough to be carried. Holding one gives what it holds and burns away the rest, so a bearer needs power enough to survive it; the fragment tears the whole of that bearer's life out of the world's record, and no one can say who they were. What stands three times removed from a life is not counted part of it, and survives the tearing.

The [[Divinity/Althane/The Stranger|Stranger]] holds an Echo Fragment at the center of [[Geography/Althane/index|Althane]]. [[People/Althane/The Broker|Tech of Sedecium]] hunts another and means to take it, holding that the fragment's removal changes nothing for the world.
